sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Student / Anonymous User
  participant V as Vue Frontend
  participant A as Auth API / Spring Security
  participant C as CaseController
  participant S as CaseService
  participant F as FileStorage
  participant D as Database
  participant N as NotificationService

  U->>V: case details + files

  alt authenticated student
    V->>A: validate JWT
    A-->>V: JWT valid
  else anonymous user
    Note over V: skip JWT validation
  end

  V->>C: POST /cases
  C->>S: createCase(request)

  alt valid request
    S->>S: validate required fields
    S->>S: check anonymous policy
    S->>S: generate tracking code and store hash if anonymous
    S->>F: save attachments
    F-->>S: stored paths
    S->>D: save case + attachments + status log
    D-->>S: case id + case number
    S->>N: send notification
    N-->>S: sent / queued
    S->>C: case number + tracking code if anonymous
    C-->>V: response
    V-->>U: display result
  else invalid request
    S-->>C: validation error
    C-->>V: error response
    V-->>U: display validation error
  end

  Note over U,N: Anonymous submissions skip JWT validation, tracking code is displayed once
